# Override FSDK's desktop-oriented components/openssh-systemd.bst preset
# (files/openssh-systemd/openssh.preset: "disable sshd.service" — sshd is
# opt-in on a desktop). A generic Podman VM guest is headless and reached
# over SSH/Cloud-init, so it must start with sshd reachable by default.
#
# systemd merges every *.preset file across /etc, /run, and
# /usr/lib/systemd/system-preset into one alphabetically sorted list; the
# first file whose pattern matches a unit wins, regardless of which
# directory it came from. This file is installed as
# 00-podman-vm.preset, which sorts before openssh.preset, so this line
# takes precedence over FSDK's own disable rule.
enable sshd.service
